{"type":"message","id":"cf20f111","parentId":"a66574dc","timestamp":"2026-06-11T22:22:20.894Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"An FHA streamline refinance lets homeowners with an existing FHA loan refinance into a new FHA loan with reduced documentation and underwriting compared with a standard refinance. It typically does not require a home appraisal, has limited credit/income verification, and must provide a “net tangible benefit,” such as a lower monthly payment or a more stable loan term. Borrowers must be current on their mortgage, and while it can lower costs or simplify the loan, it usually does not allow cash out."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":4356,"output":227,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4583,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781216536076}}
{"type":"message","id":"68ae1c7e","parentId":"cf20f111","timestamp":"2026-06-11T22:22:21.121Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Explain FHA streamline refinance in exactly 3 sentences."}],"timestamp":1781216541118}}
{"type":"message","id":"b39db1e6","parentId":"68ae1c7e","timestamp":"2026-06-11T22:22:23.582Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"An FHA streamline refinance is a simplified refinance option for homeowners who already have an FHA-insured mortgage. It usually requires less paperwork, often no appraisal, and is meant to lower the borrower’s payment or improve the loan terms through a required net tangible benefit. Borrowers generally must be current on their mortgage, and the program does not allow cash-out refinancing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":4238,"output":74,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":4312,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781216541120}}
{"type":"message","id":"abfc6798","parentId":"b39db1e6","timestamp":"2026-06-11T22:22:31.005Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's a clear and concise summary of the FHA streamline refinance! If you have any other questions or if you need assistance with a different topic, just let me know!"}],"timestamp":1781216551003}}
